L[#L+1]={cen="Eagan Peltskinner",give={id=823,k="npc",m=12,n="Deputy Willem",x=0.482,y=0.429},id=5261,lvl=2,mn=1,money=0,pl=1,pre={783},rc=589,rep={Stormwind=55},t="Eagan Pelzschneider",turn={id=196,k="npc",m=12,n="Eagan Peltskinner",x=0.489,y=0.402},tx={d="Eagan Peltskinner is looking for someone to hunt wolves for him. That's good news, because we're seeing a lot more wolves in Northshire Valley lately.{br}If you're interested then speak with Eagan. He's around the side of the abbey, to the left.",o="Speak with Eagan Peltskinner.",r="That's true. I'm looking for someone to hunt me some wolves! Are you that person?"},upd=1792844336,xp=127,y="q",zone=12}
L[#L+1]={cen="Report to Goldshire",fixed={{c=1,id=6078}},give={id=197,k="npc",m=12,n="Marshal McBride",x=0.489,y=0.416},id=54,lvl=5,mn=1,money=0,pl=5,pre={21},rc=589,rep={Stormwind=55},t="Meldung in Goldhain",turn={id=240,k="npc",m=12,n="Marshal Dughan",x=0.421,y=0.659},tx={d="$N, you are a rogue with proven interest in the security of Northshire. You are now tasked with the protection of the surrounding Elwynn Forest.{br}If you accept this duty, then I have prepared papers that must be delivered to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire. Goldshire lies along the southern road, past the border gates.",o="Take Marshal McBride's Documents to Marshal Dughan in Goldshire.",p="You have word from McBride? Northshire is a garden compared to Elwynn Forest, but I wonder what Marshal McBride has to report.{br}Here, let me have his papers...",r="Well, it says here that you've been awarded Acting Deputy Status with the Stormwind Marshals. Congratulations.{br}And good luck - keeping Elwynn safe is no picnic... what with most the army busy doing who knows what for who knows which noble!{br}It's hard to keep track of politics in these dark days..."},upd=1792846876,xp=337,y="q",zone=12}
L[#L+1]={cen="Lazy Peons",give={id=11378,k="npc",m=14,n="Foreman Thazz'ril",x=0.446,y=0.687},id=5441,lvl=4,mn=3,money=0,obj={{name="Peons Awoken",req=5,txt="Peons Awoken: 0/5",ty="monster"}},pl=4,rc=434,rep={["Darkspear Trolls"]=150,Orgrimmar=150},t="Faule Peons",ta={max=9540,min=1640,n=3,sum=13330},tm={max=8900,min=1410,n=3,sum=12070},tr={max=8900,min=1410,n=3,sum=12070},turn={id=11378,k="npc",m=14,n="Foreman Thazz'ril",x=0.447,y=0.687},tx={d="Cursed peons! They work hard gathering lumber from the trees of the valley, but they're always taking naps! I need someone to help keep the peons in line.{br}You look like the right orc for my task. Here, you take this blackjack and use it on any lazy peons you find sleeping on the job. A good smack will get them right back to work! Return the blackjack when you're done.{br}Lousy slacking peons...",o="Use the Foreman's Blackjack on Lazy Peons when they're sleeping. Wake up 5 peons, then return the Foreman's Blackjack to Foreman Thazz'ril in the Valley of Trials.",p="No good lazy...{br}Eh? Do you have my blackjack? Did you catch any peons sleeping on the job?!",r="Good, good. Maybe they'll think twice before slacking next time!{br}Thanks for the help!"},upd=1793359058,xp=556,y="q",zone=14}
L[#L+1]={cen="Supplies to the Port!",give={id=3168,k="npc",m=14,n="Flakk",x=0.53,y=0.42},id=55002,lvl=6,mn=5,rc=434,t="Supplies to the Port!",turn={id=91237,k="npc",m=14,n="Tradesman Laz",x=0.585,y=0.257},upd=1793307054,y="q"}
L[#L+1]={cen="A New Power Source",give={id=91214,k="npc",m=14,n="Technician Spuzzle",x=0.574,y=0.258},id=55003,lvl=10,mn=7,money=300,obj={{name="Energized Scale",req=6,txt="Energized Scale: 0/6",ty="item"}},pl=7,rc=434,t="A New Power Source",turn={id=91214,k="npc",m=14,n="Technician Spuzzle",x=0.574,y=0.258},tx={d="As a technician, it's our job to keep everythin' runnin' ya see? Well, we've run into a small problem, and by a small problem, I mean a big problem!{br}The Oil from the platform isn't coming in and we're barely making due with what we got! That and we're gonna run outta barrels of the juice soon.{br}But, I got an idea anyway. There's a place not far from here to the west called Thunder Ridge, and it's got that name for a reason.{br}The beasts there pack one HELL of a punch! Get me six of their energized scales, so I can tinker with them as a power source. Now, they're not gonna be givin' you their scales, so use some force!",o="Gather six Energized Scales from Lightning Hides and Thunder Lizards at Thunder Ridge to the west and bring them to Technician Spuzzle in Sparkwater Port."},upd=1792967470,y="q",zone=14}
